[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-STD006
TITLE: Taxi and hold-short cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall accept Taxi to runway two seven, hold short runway two seven, expect that readback, observe that position is unchanged before the first step, and then step until the aircraft is holding short and stopped. It shall also expect the holding-short report. Acceptance is that readback, that report, and the hold-short phase. The test file is apps/aircraft/tests/test_aircraft.py.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is the example test for taxi and hold short.
<<<
